%%{init: {"theme": "default", "themeVariables": {"background": "#ffffff"}}}%%

classDiagram
    direction TB

    class Sensor {
        +sample()
    }
    class SensorStrategy {
        <<interface>>
        +read() SensorEvent
    }
    class SimulatedSensorStrategy {
        +read() SensorEvent
    }
    class SimulationDecorator {
        <<abstract>>
        -SensorStrategy wrapped
        +read() SensorEvent
    }
    class FailureDecorator {
        +read() SensorEvent
    }
    class ScriptedOutputDecorator {
        +read() SensorEvent
    }

    Sensor --> SensorStrategy : calls
    SensorStrategy <|.. SimulatedSensorStrategy
    SensorStrategy <|.. SimulationDecorator
    SimulationDecorator o-- SensorStrategy : wraps
    SimulationDecorator <|-- FailureDecorator
    SimulationDecorator <|-- ScriptedOutputDecorator
    note for SensorStrategy "Strategy: interchangeable reading behaviour.\nConcrete strategies represent temperature, motion, door, or smoke input."
    note for SimulationDecorator "Decorator: adds failure or scripted-output behaviour.\nOne shared timer calls Sensor.sample()."

    class EventSource {
        +subscribe(observer)
        +publish(event)
    }
    class Observer {
        <<interface>>
        +onEvent(event)
    }
    class AutomationObserver {
        +onEvent(event)
    }
    class UIObserver {
        +onEvent(event)
    }
    class LogObserver {
        +onEvent(event)
    }

    Sensor --> EventSource : publishes readings and availability
    EventSource o-- Observer : notifies subscribers
    Observer <|.. AutomationObserver
    Observer <|.. UIObserver
    Observer <|.. LogObserver
    note for EventSource "Observer: typed sensor, device-state, mode, and alert events.\nMonitoring and logging stay active in every mode."

    class CommandFactory {
        -AutomationState state
        +createCommands(event) List~Command~
        +setState(state)
    }
    class AutomationState {
        <<interface>>
        +createCommands(event) List~Command~
    }
    class HomeState {
        +createCommands(event) List~Command~
    }
    class AwayState {
        +createCommands(event) List~Command~
    }
    class ObserveState {
        +createCommands(event) List~Command~
    }

    AutomationObserver --> CommandFactory : requests commands
    CommandFactory --> AutomationState : delegates to current mode
    AutomationState <|.. HomeState
    AutomationState <|.. AwayState
    AutomationState <|.. ObserveState
    UIObserver --> CommandFactory : selects mode
    note for CommandFactory "Factory: shared command-creation entry point.\nOwns one current State used by all automation observers."
    note for ObserveState "Returns an empty command list.\nNo automatic device actions or alerts."

    class Command {
        <<interface>>
        +execute()
    }
    class DeviceCommand {
        +execute()
    }
    class AlertCommand {
        +execute()
    }
    class SmartDevice {
        +apply(action)
        +getState()
    }

    Command <|.. DeviceCommand
    Command <|.. AlertCommand
    AutomationState ..> Command : creates mode-appropriate commands
    CommandFactory ..> Command : returns
    AutomationObserver --> Command : executes
    DeviceCommand --> SmartDevice : receiver
    SmartDevice --> EventSource : reports actual state or failure
    AlertCommand --> EventSource : publishes alert
    note for Command "Command: explicit device actions or alerts.\nManual controls execute commands without mode filtering."
    UIObserver --> DeviceCommand : manual controls
